more drivers decide to follow the step-by-step"},{"h":0.011836734693877471,"text":"instructions they hear, without having to check the map.","x":0.55333335052230692,"y":0.7134693877369972,"w":0.395555534362793},{"x":0.55555556165412512,"y":0.72965116240973049,"text":"For me, the popularity of sat-nav systems is further","w":0.39333332061767579,"h":0.013205980573381626},{"w":0.2666666603088379,"h":0.013185809388452596,"x":0.55555555863923189,"text":"proof that we are becoming too 2","y":0.74408163262872706},{"h":0.0087209304498165885,"w":0.037777776718139644,"text":"- on","y":0.74854651159195218,"x":0.91111111154833768},{"h":0.013115805022570481,"text":"technology. In the past, most people were able to read","y":0.75872092999693974,"x":0.55333335052230692,"w":0.395555534362793},{"y":0.7710608825401809,"x":0.55250906495638386,"h":0.017157697093730051,"w":0.086682252883911182,"text":"maps, but 3"},{"x":0.72666666720151563,"h":0.011836734693877471,"w":0.22222221374511719,"text":"_,I think most people have lost","y":0.77469387771447418},{"text":"this ability. What is even more worrying is the fact that","y":0.78775510242076385,"x":0.55333334788527011,"w":0.395555534362793,"h":0.01311699069276151},{"y":0.80004888050242629,"h":0.017331149821378733,"text":"some people seem to be losing their common sense too.","w":0.39372131347656258,"x":0.55314281210548},{"text":"Every summer I read articles about people who got","x":0.55333334887415886,"y":0.81959183711470507,"w":0.395555534362793,"h":0.01325700020303533},{"text":"into trouble because they had blindly followed the","y":0.83428571452165134,"x":0.55333334626304786,"w":0.395555534362793,"h":0.013098006735042578},{"text":"4","h":0.010174418079609837,"x":0.55111111125706291,"w":0.01111111044883728,"y":0.84593023289333469},{"y":0.84734693904019864,"text":"_ of their sat-nav, for example, the tourists","x":0.65555556109856949,"w":0.29333332061767581,"h":0.014693877551020362},{"w":0.395555534362793,"x":0.5533333377074926,"y":0.86191860470178028,"h":0.011627906487912454,"text":"who drove their rental car into the ocean just because"},{"text":"their device told them to drive ahead. Driving requires","x":0.55333334933712175,"y":0.87632653063723442,"h":0.014693877551020473,"w":0.395555534362793},{"y":0.88938775509515611,"text":"focus - you can't lose 5","h":0.014693877551020473,"x":0.55333334122411637,"w":0.17777776718139648},{"h":0.013306609173210249,"text":"of where you're","x":0.83108194021556347,"y":0.8908757651235153,"w":0.11783612251281739},{"text":"going. Road and traffic signs are just as important as","h":0.013252254408232966,"x":0.55333334887415886,"y":0.90552325559650371,"w":0.395555534362793},{"y":0.92285714303793664,"w":0.095555553436279306,"h":0.0089795918367346905,"text":"your sat-nav.","x":0.55111111336519358}]